(Bug #74 at the call site. #65 added the argument check; it consults the same
 oracle as the declaration check, so both went blind on a property read at the
 same instant. The callee stores the argument in a text slot and reads it as
 text, so this faulted one frame from the sentence that caused it.)

To 'shout' with a text called word. Return a text, word.

a list called counts is [10, 20, 30].
Print 'shout' of counts's length.
